{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t5yNS06HRH1795157362.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國防部長董軍與英國國防大臣施卓添會談，是26年來首次有中國防長訪英。</p><p></p><p>國防部指，董軍應邀訪問英國，周四與施卓添會談，雙方就兩國兩軍關係、國際地區形勢和共同關心的問題，深入交換意見，表示將共同落實好兩國領導人重要共識，推動兩軍關係持續健康穩定發展。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.UK-1400_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kix6Qe9tCc1795157372.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>施卓添就發文指，英國國內會有意見質疑英中高層加強直接往來的必要性，強調政府對英中關係涉及的風險與機遇，均能務實且警醒評估。他主張中國的影響力大到不容忽視，若因雙方有分歧，即認定合作既不可能、也不可取，是危險的推論。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:24:03.782155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T19:37:33.266608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:17:23.445858+00:00","content_hash":"f3f27bcadab8c727148e2156006db78e357ee240833b8e1c4416a98a130effe6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:24:03.782155+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}